    <p class="text-sm text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed">
      With our browser-based <strong>favicon maker</strong>, you can convert <strong>png to favicon</strong> packages in seconds:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed">
