      <li><strong>Multi-Resolution Binary ICO Assembly:</strong> Our client-side encoder compiles crisp 16×16 and 32×32 PNG frames into a single binary <code class="font-mono text-xs">.ico</code> file right inside your browser.</li>
      <li><strong>Real-Time Device Mockups:</strong> Unlike traditional converters that only display a flat thumbnail, our <strong>favicon maker</strong> features a live device studio where you can see your icon in Chrome dark and light tabs, macOS Safari, Google SERP snippets, iOS home screen squircles, and Android circle launchers.</li>
      <li><strong>100% Client-Side Privacy:</strong> Your images are never uploaded to remote servers. All canvas processing, image resizing, and ZIP generation occur locally in your browser, guaranteeing instant speed and total data privacy.</li>
